      "behtml_lib_2",
      "BEHTML library (lib_bejson_BEHTML_validator.py): behtml_validator_validate_document(doc, strict_types=False) validates a BEJSON document against the BEHTML_ROOT_RECORDS_TYPE / KNOWN_ELEMENT_TYPES schema -- checks element IDs are present and unique, element types are known, parent references resolve, and spatial values are legal (delegates the actual X/Y math checks to lib_bejson_BEHTML_core's behtml_core_validate_x_address / behtml_core_validate_quantization / behtml_core_y_span_to_px). Returns a list of error strings, empty if valid.",
